msgstr ""
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-film-alege?id=&lt;id&gt;|oprit</code>, "
"<code>POST /api/subtitrari-film-intarziere?ms=N</code> (alebo <code>pas=</"
"code>), <code>POST /api/subtitrari-film-codare?cod=..</code>, <code>POST /"
"api/subtitrari-film-fps?fps=..</code>: rovnaké voľby ako tlačidlo SUB pri "
